    "updated_at": "2016-03-25T05:06:36Z",
    "body": "I figured @bzbarsky would have tested, but testing this for `<a>` in Chrome, Firefox, and Safari, which is focusable but not reachable through sequential focus navigation, I get 0, not -1.\n\nI should probably add a clarifying note here (instead of changing the normative requirements) that sequential focus navigation is immaterial to whether or not `tabIndex` returns 0.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
