    "created_at": "2016-03-27T08:48:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-27T08:48:47Z",
    "body": "So that would mean we'd need \"mouse focusable\", \"tab focusable\", but then that probably varies per platform too? Touch?\n\nUser interaction depending on platform is why I've never been super thrilled to sort out how it works, since there's not really a canonical model.\n\nNot sure what to do here.\n",
