    "updated_at": "2016-03-27T13:31:05Z",
    "body": "And in particular, some elements show a focus ring whenever they're focused, some only when they are focused via keyboard, and which ones are in which bucket may vary by platform and OS (accessibility) settings, just like which set of elements are tabbable can vary.\n",
